Package: popgenutils
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Helpers for SSR Population-Genetic Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Seema", "Parveen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "seema6203@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A small toolkit that wraps the recurring steps of a microsatellite
    (SSR) diversity study into documented, reusable functions: reading GenAlEx
    files, per-population diversity summaries, pairwise F-statistics, AMOVA,
    bootstrapped neighbour-joining trees, and principal coordinates analysis.
    Grew out of one-off scripts written for a study of Indian Nymphaea
    (water lily) populations.
